Neo branding assets

The current favicon-v4.svg, PNG/ICO icons, manifest icons and social-share.png
are original geometric Neo artwork generated by scripts/generate-neo-brand-assets.mjs.
Legacy v3 asset filenames contain the same new artwork for URL compatibility.

